---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const contactEmail = 'support@pumpdeck.app';
const lastUpdated = 'June 10, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service — PumpDeck"
  description="The terms that govern your use of PumpDeck."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-600">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-soft">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div
      class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-ink-soft [&_h2]:text-xl [&_h2]:font-semibold [&_h2]:text-ink [&_a]:text-brand-600 [&_a]:underline"
    >
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <p>
          By downloading or using PumpDeck (the "app"), you agree to these Terms
          of Service. If you do not agree, please do not use the app.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2>Use of the app</h2>
        <p>
          PumpDeck grants you a personal, non-transferable, non-exclusive license
          to use the app on devices you own or control, for your own
          fitness-tracking purposes.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2>Health disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          PumpDeck is a fitness-tracking tool, not medical advice. Consult a
          qualified professional before beginning any exercise program. You are
          responsible for training safely and within your limits.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2>Your account and content</h2>
        <p>
          You are responsible for activity under your account and for the data you
          enter. You retain ownership of the content you create in the app.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2>Availability</h2>
        <p>
          We aim to keep the app and sync service available, but we provide them
          "as is" without warranty of uninterrupted operation. Features may change
          over time.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the fullest extent permitted by law, PumpDeck is not liable for any
          indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of
          the app.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the app
          after changes take effect constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about these terms? Email
          <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
